1
00:00:11,184 --> 00:00:13,648
What’s your favourite story, Teng Fei?

2
00:00:14,176 --> 00:00:16,432
Oh, I l ike this one.

3
00:00:17,056 --> 00:00:18,976
A farmer lost his horse.

4
00:00:19,184 --> 00:00:21,488
His neighbours said, “How unlucky!”

5
00:00:21,888 --> 00:00:24,480
But the farmer just said, “Maybe.”

6
00:00:25,296 --> 00:00:29,296
Later, his horse came back with seven other horses.

7
00:00:29,712 --> 00:00:34,784
People said, “That’s great!” But the farmer said, “Maybe.”

8
00:00:35,312 --> 00:00:37,552
Later, his son broke his leg

9
00:00:37,664 --> 00:00:39,376
when he tried to ride a horse.

10
00:00:39,776 --> 00:00:43,312
People said, “That’s terrible!” Again,

11
00:00:43,744 --> 00:00:46,016
the farmer said, “Maybe.”

12
00:00:46,608 --> 00:00:51,248
Well, because of his leg, the son didn’t have to join a war.

13
00:00:51,856 --> 00:00:53,136
That saved his life!

14
00:00:53,648 --> 00:00:57,648
I see. Unlucky things may turn out well.

15
00:00:58,064 --> 00:01:00,864
And good things could go wrong too.

16
00:01:01,184 --> 00:01:03,280
Yes, you never know

